  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8d6b0553197f4bdbb1e237e452294d3c, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: UValidation.Showcase::UValidation.Showcase.DictionaryShowcaseOverview
  m_Instructions: 'Unity 6.6 serializes Dictionary<TKey, TValue> fields marked with [SerializeField].


    Select each numbered GameObject to inspect valid and intentionally invalid dictionary examples. UValidation treats dictionary values as collection elements; Unity owns duplicate and null-key diagnostics.


    Dictionary validation messages stay at field level so Unity''s native two-column editor and key diagnostics remain unchanged.


    Use UValidation > Rebuild Dictionary Showcase to restore all examples.'
